<!-- ============ SERVICES PREVIEW ============ -->
<section class="section alt">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="kicker">What we build</div>
    <h2>Four systems, one workshop.</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">From a single residential door to a full commercial facade — designed, fabricated, and installed under one roof.</p>
    <div class="services-grid">
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="photo-frame service-photo"><img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/7638806/pexels-photo-7638806.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=700" alt="Contemporary glass and metal double doors"></div>
        <div class="service-body">
          <h3>Doors</h3>
          <p>Durable, secure aluminium doors for residential and commercial entries, sliding or hinged.</p>
          <div class="service-spec">SPEC — powder-coat / multi-point lock</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="photo-frame service-photo"><img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/30728904/pexels-photo-30728904.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=700" alt="Minimalist wall with aluminium shutters"></div>
        <div class="service-body">
          <h3>Windows</h3>
          <p>Aluminium and glass windows built for energy efficiency, comfort, and a clean sightline.</p>
          <div class="service-spec">SPEC — Low-E / thermal break</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="photo-frame service-photo"><img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/7078620/pexels-photo-7078620.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=700" alt="Glass facade of an office building"></div>
        <div class="service-body">
          <h3>Glass</h3>
          <p>Tempered, laminated, and UV-protected glass for partitions, facades, and decorative work.</p>
          <div class="service-spec">SPEC — tempered / laminated / etched</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="photo-frame service-photo"><img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/18356512/pexels-photo-18356512.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=700" alt="Modern office building windows grid pattern"></div>
        <div class="service-body">
          <h3>Curtain Walls</h3>
          <p>Structural curtain-wall systems for commercial towers, engineered for load and wind.</p>
          <div class="service-spec">SPEC — unitized / stick-built</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top:36px;"><a href="/services" class="btn btn-primary">View All Services</a></div>
  </div>
</section>


<!-- ============ STATS ============ -->
<section class="section dark">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="kicker">By the numbers</div>
    <h2>Two decades of fabrication, on the record.</h2>
    <div class="stats-banner">
      <div class="stat-cell"><b>20+</b><span>Years in business</span></div>
      <div class="stat-cell"><b>500+</b><span>Projects delivered</span></div>
      <div class="stat-cell"><b>3</b><span>Sectors served</span></div>
      <div class="stat-cell"><b>5</b><span>Cities covered</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<div class="strip">
  <div class="wrap" style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
    <h3>Trusted by architects, builders, and homeowners across Pakistan.</h3>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Get a Free Consultation</a>
  </div>
</div>


<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="kicker">Client feedback</div>
    <h2>What our clients say.</h2>
    <div class="quote-grid">
      <div class="quote-card"><div class="quote-mark">"</div><p>Excellent service and top-notch quality. Our project was delivered on time and exceeded expectations.</p><div class="quote-name">Sarah K. — Architect</div></div>
      <div class="quote-card"><div class="quote-mark">"</div><p>Great support and custom solutions for our unique requirements, start to finish.</p><div class="quote-name">Ahmed R. — Contractor</div></div>
      <div class="quote-card"><div class="quote-mark">"</div><p>Highly recommend for anyone looking for reliable aluminium and glass work.</p><div class="quote-name">Maria L. — Homeowner</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<!-- ============ FAQ ============ -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="kicker">Common questions</div>
    <h2>Before you get in touch.</h2>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <details class="faq-item"><summary>Do you handle both residential and commercial projects?</summary><p>Yes. We fabricate everything from a single home window to full curtain-wall systems for commercial towers, all from the same in-house workshop.</p></details>
      <details class="faq-item"><summary>How long does a typical project take?</summary><p>Small residential jobs are usually complete within one to two weeks of design sign-off; larger commercial fit-outs are scoped individually during the consultation.</p></details>
      <details class="faq-item"><summary>Do you offer a warranty on installations?</summary><p>All hardware and workmanship are covered under warranty terms agreed at contract signing — details vary by system and are confirmed in your quote.</p></details>
      <details class="faq-item"><summary>Which cities do you currently serve?</summary><p>We're based in Islamabad and work across Rawalpindi, DHA and Bahria Town, Lahore, and Karachi on request.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


